y with a 0.18 error rate. v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release, since v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1 are both marked unhealthy. The rollback was verified, and a follow-up status check shows v2.3.0 healthy in all regions with an error rate of 0.002.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the rollback, and the next steps: confirm the error rate stays at baseline, investigate the v2.3.1 failure before re-releasing, and confirm on-call has taken ownership.\n\nNo change-manager approval was needed, because v2.3.0 has been healthy in production.", "type": "text"}]}]}